# AI session logs

The challenge explicitly requires the full transcript of every AI coding session.

Do not submit fabricated logs. Export your real Cursor / Claude Code / Copilot transcripts and place them here, for example:

```text
logs/
  2026-09-17-session-01.md
  2026-09-18-session-02.md
```

Include enough context to show:
- prompts/instructions you gave the tool
- generated changes
- corrections you made
- bugs you caught
- decisions you overruled
- test/debug iterations

This README is only a placeholder until the real transcripts are added.
